.venv/
__pycache__/
.git/
.env
*.md
tests/
*.duckdb
# `data/` (the 80KB sample dataset + fixtures/queries the README's example commands reference)
# is deliberately NOT excluded here — it used to be, which meant Dockerfile's `COPY data ./data`
# would have had nothing to copy even after that line was added (a parent-directory .dockerignore
# exclusion can't be selectively un-excluded — found during the POC 2 closure sweep). `examples/`
# (the multi-MB real Olist datasets) doesn't need an entry here: Dockerfile never COPYs it, so
# it's excluded from the image regardless of this file.
